[1]}],"link":"85926","synopsis":"Tra le due famiglie della yakuza Somei e Miyama sembra essere tornata la pace: Yoshino, nipote del boss Somei, deve andare a Tokyo per incontrare Kirishima, nipote del boss Miyama, con cui presumibilmente dovrà sposarsi. Kirishima è davvero il ragazzo gentile che sembra?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dcZjtc7xVJqsk1cFmo84GOihYuu.jpg"},{"title":"Voglio mostrarti la mia sincerità. E, se possibile, farti innamorare un po' di me.","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"86033","synopsis":"La figlia del presidente Akaza è scomparsa, o per rapimento oppure perché è semplicemente scappata di casa. Per la sua incolumità, Yoshino deve restare sempre con Kirishima, il quale ha molte informazioni sulla giovane scomparsa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fG777fgvptkaL4Hkn1ohnHuEZ3s.jpg"},{"title":"Il triangolo amoroso dell'inferno","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"86252","synopsis":"Proprio quando Kirishima e Yoshino iniziano ad avvicinarsi un po', da Osaka arriva un caro amico della ragazza.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/upx8ZmcTnF6VAxDd67Z3RMACw93.jpg"},{"title":"Is He Smart or Stupid?","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"86370","synopsis":"After a tense encounter between Kirishima and Shouma, Shouma drives back to Osaka. Yoshino gets the sense that something is spoiling Kirishima's mood and confronts him. Like every year, Yoshino catches a summer flu.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tSeHiyTwFS5BbA17UqIeq95UeFZ.jpg"},{"title":"The Camellia Princess","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"86469","synopsis":"After their final exams, Yoshino and Kirishima head to Yokohama to meet Yoshino's cousin, Tsubaki Akashigata, who recently moved from Kyoto. Reuniting after a long time, the three—Yoshino, Tsubaki, and Kirishima, who tagged along—explore the city together. They enjoy reminiscing and chatting about trivial things as they stroll through Yokohama. However, their fun is interrupted when Yoshino gets a call from school and has to leave, leaving the other two behind.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oppGTjER2LawziahjgGLz62XlFO.jpg"},{"title":"I'd Rather Be Hated if You're Indifferent – Part 1","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86568","synopsis":"Returning to Japan after living abroad, Nao Shioda lands a job as a TV announcer. She crosses paths with Kirishima, her ex-boyfriend from the past. In front of their friends, the two pretend to be strangers, but when they find themselves alone, Kirishima gently speaks to Nao and hands her his contact information.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e8Zkk8drFEwb4nKzWERXuNrpZxH.jpg"},{"title":"I'd Rather Be Hated if You're Indifferent – Part 2","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86649","synopsis":"From her seat on the bus, Nao spots Kirishima and Yoshino walking together. Unable to ignore them, she gets off at the next stop to follow. However, it's Yoshino who approaches Nao first. The two women begin to talk, and the conversation inevitably turns to their shared connection: Kirishima.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/neoaitcrPNiRrIuZCT9YqXlWp5I.jpg"},{"title":"If I’m Honest, I Want to Get Married – Part 1","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"86739","synopsis":"The semi-criminal group holding grudges against Yoshino and Kirishima, along with Azami Suou, had gathered under Ozu’s command. While Kirishima was with Nao, Yoshino spotted Ozu and his group and decided to carry out a plan on her own. Upon learning about Yoshino’s situation, Kirishima reluctantly contacted Shoma, the only person he could turn to in Osaka, to entrust Nao to him and head toward Yoshino. During this time, Kirishima called Yoshino, and the two made a significant \"bet.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uPOKw54BcOKdLjqIrnE0dmSHFFb.jpg"},{"title":"If I’m Honest, I Want to Get Married – Part 2","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"86834","synopsis":"Kirishima finds himself in the crowded chaos of a fireworks festival, while Yoshino and a group of delinquents gather nearby. Yoshino chases after Oz, who has been abducted by Naoya, while Kirishima blends into the crowd and launches a surprise attack on the delinquents. Targeted due to the incident involving Shiori Akaza, Yoshino is spotted by Naoya and faces imminent danger. Kirishima continues to take down the delinquents one by one, but a mysterious and dangerous figure, Azami Suo, suddenly appears before him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ickI6hWZBJntT3c0xr4iJ5s8MfP.jpg"},{"title":"If I’m Honest, I Want to Get Married – Part 3","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"86965","synopsis":"Azami's true intentions for searching for Yoshino and the words Minami said to Shoma before leaving remain shrouded in mystery as Azami and the others disappear without a trace. Left behind, Kirishima and Yoshino confront Ozu, who has been captured, demanding he settle Naoya's scandals and promise never to interfere with them again. Despite Ozu's skillful maneuvering, always stopping just short of breaking the law and avoiding creating any vulnerabilities, Kirishima sets a trap for him. With the case resolved, Kirishima earns the right to be Yoshino's boyfriend and enthusiastically presses forward, only for Yoshino to propose a certain challenge to him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptFPhaSDv3hm9hxLOSVVsBUkDTU.jpg"},{"title":"A Wild Creature You Can't Keep Once it Grows Up","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"87080","synopsis":"After visiting the Somei family grave, Kirishima is invited to the Somei group, where he spends a pleasant time. The group enjoys a barbecue together, sharing stories about young Tsubaki, who looked strikingly similar to Kirishima. Renji, one of Tsubaki's few close friends, reminisces about the past and shares nostalgic tales with Yoshino and Kirishima. However, the atmosphere becomes tense when Hotei returns from work. Summoned to the basement by Renji, Kirishima and Shoma are questioned about the uproar involving semi-outlaw groups that occurred in the Kansai region, a matter that also entangled Yoshino.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zemM6S5wREkISFN764MftdRYhiH.jpg"},{"title":"As She Fades, a Dark Night Falls, and the Rain Begins to Pour","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"441190","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87196","synopsis":"After a tumultuous visit to her hometown, Yoshino and Kirishima return from Osaka to the Miyama residence in Tokyo. They thought their usual daily life would resume as always, but from the very next day, Yoshino starts ignoring Kirishima. She alters her schedule to avoid him when going to school, ignores him when he speaks, and offers no response even when he cooks for her. A rare moment of distress overtakes Kirishima, who sits in the rain in front of the annex where Yoshino is staying. What is the reason Yoshino continues to ignore Kirishima...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/528McUWXnd16mLbHovErfo8dzRU.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":170468,"malId":56964},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:170468","mal:56964"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18249","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"170468","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"56964","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259787","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-